"Leon hid in the Abyssal Temple while fleeing the mermen, and its master swore revenge."
"The shadow octopus was a cheap master with few rewards, and refused the alliance."
"Syl and her personas plugged the chasm and sealed the Labyrinth of the Abyss."
"The caretaker ghost gave Syl an ancient lion-crested armor set for sealing the chasm."
"The ghost resents that the new seal is far stronger than it needed to be."
"Keldenar pointed Syl to the Labyrinth of Frozen Dreams with a direction golem."
"Syl and Vee are inside Frozen Dreams; Moonscar fell and reset on them three times."
"Beneath Moonscar is a lab that grows meat-people in vats and butchers them to feed the town."
"Moonscar's warden, innkeeper and lab boss were heavily tainted by curse."
"Syl and Vee have since broken the wendigo loop by slaying the tainted townsfolk."
"The taint of the slain flows up into the lord's castle."
"A gaunt wendigo variant regrows limbs from curse energy; its ghostly claws pass through."
"Only draining its curse dry kills that variant; it then collapses in on itself."
"Drain Touch can pull curse energy out of a wendigo into the caster."
"Inside Frozen Dreams dimension magic is limited and a Rift Door will not stay stable."
"The [Dungeoneer] Emblem gives no sign at all inside a labyrinth."
